[{"client_msg_id":"bd2f4755-2d60-44f2-9485-ca62ec314963","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"報告です。原因を調べているよりもう一度環境を作り直した方が早いと感じ、環境を作り直しました。\nこのあとも原因を探してみたいと思います。アドバイスして下さった皆さんありがとうございました。","ts":"1631024141.189000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":2,"users":["U78A6ESHM","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9XYB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8265365c-c801-4ace-b1cd-3b19f017c668","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":":kakko-kabu-tojikakko:","ts":"1631016281.185900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BRX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07e69a2c-c4a7-4b70-ba17-be4ba273dc3e","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"`:verbose set completeopt` でどこで使ってるかみるといいかもです","ts":"1631016276.185700","edited":{"user":"U78A6ESHM","ts":"1631016298.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nRjh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f268d96-f905-410b-8448-aa8ddc2756c6","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":":verbose set completeopt","ts":"1631016273.185600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5vnD+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0de07258-63e6-4de0-bd53-df3fde093d43","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"補完が絡んできそうなプラグインと、補完絡みのinit.vimの設定を全部コメントアウトして見ましたが、うまく行きませんでした...","ts":"1631016189.184600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zjYyh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3cbf7689-7cca-46ef-a929-8f8f67a8842a","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"`オプションのコンマ区切りのリスト。`\nこれですねー。","ts":"1631009497.179300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eVD"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\n                                                *'completeopt'* *'cot'*\n'completeopt' 'cot'     文字列  (既定では \"menu,preview\")\n                        グローバル\n        入力モードでの補完|ins-completion|についてのオプションのコンマ区切りの\n        リスト。サポートされている値は次の通り:\n \n           menu     ポップアップメニューで補完候補を表示する。ポップアップメ\n                    ニューは、候補が2個以上あり、十分な数の色が使用できるとき\n                    だけ表示される。|ins-completion-menu|を参照。\n \n           menuone  候補が1つしかないときもポップアップメニューを使う。候補に\n                    ついて付加的な情報があるときに便利である。例えば、それがど\n                    のファイルに含まれているかなど。\n \n           longest  候補の文字列の最長の共通部分だけを挿入する。メニューが表示\n                    されているならばCTRL-Lでさらに文字を挿入することができる。\n                    大文字・小文字が同一視されるかどうかは補完の種類による。\n                    バッファのテキストについてはオプション 'ignorecase' が適用\n                    される。\n \n           preview  現在選択されている候補についての付加的な情報をプレビュー\n                    ウィンドウに表示する。\"menu\" または \"menuone\" と組み合わせ\n                    たときのみ有効。\n \n           popup    現在選択されている補完に関する追加情報をポップアップウィン\n                    ドウに表示する。\"menu\" または \"menuone\" との組み合わせでの\n                    み機能する。\"preview\" を無視する。\n                    指定するプロパティについては |'completepopup'| を参照。\n                    {|+textprop| 機能付きでコンパイルされたときのみ有効}\n \n           popuphidden\n                    \"popup\" と同様だが、最初はポップアップを非表示にする。\n                    |CompleteChanged| 自動コマンドを使用して情報を取得し、ポッ\n                    プアップがいっぱいになれば |popup_show()| を呼び出す。\n                    |complete-popuphidden| の例を参照。\n                    {|+textprop| 機能付きでコンパイルされたときのみ有効}\n \n           noinsert いかなるマッチしたテキストも、ユーザーがメニューから選択し\n                    ない限り挿入しない。\"menu\" か \"menuone\" と組み合わせたとき\n                    にだけ機能する。\"longest\" が指定された場合には、なんの影響\n                    も発生しない。\n \n           noselect メニューからマッチを {訳注:自動では} 選択せず、ユーザーに\n                    自分で選ぶことを強制する。\"menu\" か \"menuone\" と組み合わせ\n                    たときにだけ機能する。\n```","ts":"1631009460.178800","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"09dc11e8-ec77-475b-b2c0-c8ae01956065","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":":h completeopt","ts":"1631009460.178700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xho"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c43563b0-b881-467f-9092-7632a20a34be","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"返信ありがとうございます。ちょっとプラグインを確認してみます。","ts":"1631009432.178400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pJAph"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27ccf54e-4ed1-449f-bbbb-e311b4ee275f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"なにもいじってなくてなったのなら、プラグインのどっかが設定しようとしてNGが出る、かね?","ts":"1631009349.176900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3Kr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"006ec27a-3e32-4fb6-8589-0760b58dab93","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"`set completeopt=menuone,noinsert,noselect`","ts":"1631009295.176000","edited":{"user":"U78A6ESHM","ts":"1631009330.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"01Gbk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E63A72CE-BD0A-417B-95A1-1DA130943250","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"株）","ts":"1631009260.174900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CtE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63A2E1A2-0BF2-4771-844C-5EDCFE6E66CB","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"ドットではなくカンマに","ts":"1631009243.174200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MmUE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9837cf9f-b26f-4da5-b206-254a8229faca","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"`.` じゃなくて `,` ですかね。","ts":"1631009240.174000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cx="}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c92cb7f-d413-4e9f-9651-e333b6099de4","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"最近AndroidのTermuxというアプリでNeovimを使っていたのですが、今日insert modeで\n\nE474: Invalid argument: completeopt=\u003chttp://menuone.no|menuone.no\u003e\ninsert.noselect\n\nというエラーが入力毎に出てしまい入力がしづらくなって困っています。対策方法を教えてください。よろしくお願いします。","ts":"1631009116.173300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uI6xV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef706785-3cb6-4ed6-9bc3-b21d75d8baf1","type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"突然の質問失礼します","ts":"1631008939.168800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ok_hand","count":1,"users":["UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a96G0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b831a20-9c53-44ac-b5fc-45e193cd4377","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"それでとりあえずは大体なんとかなってしまう","ts":"1631008219.167900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VtOS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2ea393b5-fbf1-4b4c-a6da-261d432f610d","type":"message","user":"U01J7703PFT","text":"ちょっと変なことあったらとりあえず`:CocRestart` しちゃう","ts":"1631008203.167500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"m=uF3"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"\u003c@U02DSF5LU84\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1631006435.166700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"fa0d5f94-146a-438c-84f7-bb55f9c3c4e6","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":":call coc#float#close_all() ずっと知りたかった","ts":"1630993652.166300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3AX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e17fc4d-867e-44b8-97ef-b312abbd23bf","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"大変ですけど、便利ですよ！","ts":"1630992999.165500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Jv2T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0c998e7-c205-427e-aa5d-950314edbf9e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"消えなかったりするの大変だなぁ","ts":"1630992757.165300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G=Mnu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa45b11c-144b-43a3-a246-9a3c8e9a2247","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ありすえさんが以前書いてた\n```function! s:focus_floating() abort\n  if !empty(nvim_win_get_config(win_getid()).relative)\n    wincmd p\n    return\n  endif\n  for winnr in range(1, winnr('$'))\n    let winid = win_getid(winnr)\n    let conf = nvim_win_get_config(winid)\n    if conf.focusable \u0026amp;\u0026amp; !empty(conf.relative)\n      call win_gotoid(winid)\n      return\n    endif\n  endfor\n  execute \"normal! \\\u0026lt;C-w\u0026gt;\\\u0026lt;C-w\u0026gt;\"\nendfunction\nnnoremap \u0026lt;silent\u0026gt; \u0026lt;C-w\u0026gt;\u0026lt;C-w\u0026gt; :\u0026lt;C-u\u0026gt;call \u0026lt;SID\u0026gt;focus_floating()\u0026lt;CR\u0026gt;```\n入れてるんですが、強制的にfloat winに入ってエラーのテキストとかをyankできるので結構使ってます","ts":"1630992621.164900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sugoi","count":1,"users":["U014M3YCYAD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JeK15"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1737c5aa-b61d-4a72-924f-4266939d62bf","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"順番に回れるのか","ts":"1630992542.164100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PIt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"54724ac3-3744-466b-b01f-5c62cdbae711","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"全然違っていた","ts":"1630992532.163900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9/kl"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nCTRL-W w                                        *CTRL-W_w* *CTRL-W_CTRL-W*\nCTRL-W CTRL-W   カウント指定なし: カーソルをカレントウィンドウの下／右のウィン\n                ドウに移動。下／右にウィンドウがなければ、一番上／左のウィンド\n                ウに移動。カウント指定有り: N番目のウィンドウに移動 (ウィンド\n                ウは左上から右下へと番号が振られる)。ウィンドウの番号を知るに\n                は |bufwinnr()| と |winnr()| を参照。N がウィンドウの個数より\n                大きい場合、最後のウィンドウへ移動する。\n```","ts":"1630992499.163400","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"33f2b62d-1f7c-4ebe-851b-03062940a04d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":":h CTRL-W_CTRL-W","ts":"1630992498.163300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y75Ki"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce8833df-4048-4c80-9ef6-d86b48531354","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"floatに入れるというか、最後にフォーカスがあったウィンドウに移動とかだから入れることがあるみたいな、詳細怪しい・・・","ts":"1630992497.163100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Pj/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ece0815-1215-4684-b303-86dc144e1a5b","type":"message","user":"U014M3YCYAD","text":"`:call coc#float#close_all()` で消えました！\n\u0026lt;C-w\u0026gt;\u0026lt;C-w\u0026gt;は別の操作を振っていたので、これでfloatに入れることは知らなかったです...\n当面、\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;\u0026lt;Esc\u0026gt;に振ろうと思います。助かりました。","ts":"1630992396.162300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rS/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0d1a0ff-ef2c-47df-a2e3-486cd2f2a388","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"ちゃんとdein#tapでプラグイン確認しつつ片付けるコマンド叩いていく関数作ります","ts":"1630992187.160900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5jWt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7e07d5c-c1a3-4b52-890c-688459402a99","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"まさに自分のやつそんな感じで辛いですね。","ts":"1630992149.160300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XSZr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fccaba85-bd96-4d0d-9b4c-3cc4aea38d5f","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そんな感じで増えていくやつ","ts":"1630992132.160000","